Project Overview
This project analyzes Human Resources (HR) data using Microsoft Power BI to explore employee demographics, workforce distribution, and attrition trends.

The dashboard provides interactive visualizations to support data-driven HR decisions.

🎯 Project Objectives
Analyze employee demographics and workforce distribution.
Monitor employee headcount and attrition rates.
Identify employee turnover trends.
Explore workforce patterns across departments.
Support HR decision-making through data visualization.

🛠️ Tools & Technologies
Microsoft Power BI
Power Query

📈 Key Features
HR key performance indicators (KPIs).
Employee headcount and attrition analysis.
Workforce breakdown by department and employee categories.
Interactive filters and visualizations.
